  ## Design

  ### Part 1: BI-20.1 `/mode` command

  **New file**: `packages/tui/src/mount/mode-command.ts`

  Contains:
  - `MODE_COMMAND_NAME = "mode"`
  - `modeCommandCandidates: readonly Candidate[]` = `[{ name: "mode", description: "切换工作模式（plan/edit/build/yolo；无参显示当前态）" }]`
  - `parseModeArgs(rest)` → structured result: `{ ok: true, args: { target?: ModeId } }` or `{ ok: false, error: { code, message } }`
  - `dispatchModeCommand(line, ports)` → dispatch result

  **Host port** (`ModeCommandPorts`):
  - `selector: ModeSelector` (core organ) — holds current mode, `setMode`, `intercept`
  - `gate?: PermissionGate` — the permission gate (to set manual in plan mode)
  - `onModeChange?` — hook

  **Behavior**:
